# ── Internal / not for publication ───────────────────────────────
.workbuddy-ai/
PROJECT.md

# ── 01_Dokumen: only the setup guide is published ────────────────
# Excluded on purpose:
#   WhatsApp Chat ...            private committee chat export (not ours to publish)
#   BUKTI_KOMITE_2026-10-31.md   quotes that chat verbatim
#   *Handbook*.pdf / handbook_text.txt   the organiser's document
#   README_lama_workBuddy_work.md         superseded legacy index
01_Dokumen/*
!01_Dokumen/CARA_IMPORT_SKILL.md

# ── 02_Sumber: the official public documents ARE published ───────
# The curriculum sources are official public documents from Kemendikdasmen.
# They are redistributed unmodified, with attribution, and are NOT covered by
# this project's MIT licence (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). A cloner can then
# verify every quoted fact against the original rather than trusting our summary.
02_Sumber/*
!02_Sumber/README.md
!02_Sumber/extract_pdf.py
!02_Sumber/Final Panduan Mata Pelajaran IPAS_03_10_2025_Revisi 4.pdf
!02_Sumber/Permendikdasmen-no-13-tahun-2025.pdf
!02_Sumber/extracted/
02_Sumber/extracted/*
!02_Sumber/extracted/panduan_ipas.txt
!02_Sumber/extracted/permendikdasmen_13_2025.txt

